From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: [PATCH 0030] meson-vdec: always terminate a drain with V4L2_BUF_FLAG_LAST

A V4L2_DEC_CMD_STOP on this driver could never complete, so a video that reached its
natural end left the player hanging: the decoder fell silent, the audio renderer drained,
and ExoPlayer waited forever for a video end-of-stream that never came. The owner sees
this as "SmartTube does not return to its own screen when a video ends".

Measured on 21.09.2026 (H.264, 393 s clip, natural end, no key presses):

  00:31:27.308  DecodeComponent  queueTask(): flags=0x2, index=4195   <- the EOS work
  00:31:27.308  V4L2Decoder      drain() / sendV4L2DecoderCmd(start=0)
  00:31:27.373  V4L2Decoder      Set state Decoding => Draining
  00:31:27.5xx  six tail frames dequeued, every one of them isLast=0
  (nothing ever again)

3034 CAPTURE dequeues over the whole run, isLast=1 exactly zero times. Meanwhile
ExoPlayer's audio sink had already drained and called playToEndOfStream 25622 times over
the following 4 min 18 s.

Cause: V4L2_BUF_FLAG_LAST was attached in dst_buf_done() only to a *real* decoded frame,
and only while esparser_queued_bufs <= 1. That counter also covers frames the DPB still
holds, and it is decremented *after* dst_buf_done(), so towards the end of a stream it
never falls to 1 before the hardware goes quiet. The drain is then left without a
terminator and both sides wait for each other.

The V4L2 stateful decoder interface requires the opposite: a V4L2_DEC_CMD_STOP must
always be completed by a CAPTURE buffer carrying V4L2_BUF_FLAG_LAST, and when no decoded
frame is left the driver must return an empty (bytesused = 0) buffer with that flag.
v4l2_m2m_force_last_buf_done() does not cover this case: it only fires when the capture
queue is streaming but the device has not started.

So: after CMD_STOP a delayed worker watches the capture side and, when the flush has
actually been requested and the hardware has then been quiet for 200 ms without LAST
having gone out, hands userspace an empty CAPTURE buffer with V4L2_BUF_FLAG_LAST and
queues V4L2_EVENT_EOS. A new last_sent flag keeps the normal path and the backstop from
both firing, and is cleared everywhere should_stop/eos_queued are.

"The flush has actually been requested" matters, or the terminator would cut the tail off:
codecs with codec_ops->drain (VP9, HEVC) go through vdec_drain_work(), which deliberately
waits for the esparser backlog to stop shrinking - up to 10 s - before calling drain(),
and during that wait the capture queue is silent. So the terminator additionally requires
drain_issued for those codecs and eos_queued for eos_sequence codecs (H.264, where the
dummy picture is fed from the esparser_queue_all_src work item). An absolute 15 s deadline
from CMD_STOP remains as a last resort - above vdec_drain_work()'s own 10 s ceiling -
because a truncated tail is still far better than the infinite hang this patch removes.

v4l2_codec2 needs no change: V4L2Decoder sets mDrainLastSeen before it looks at the
payload, and a zero-length MMAP capture buffer is re-queued instead of being copied.

vdec_eos_work() deliberately does not take sess->lock, exactly like vdec_drain_work():
vdec_stop_streaming() calls cancel_delayed_work_sync() while holding that same lock, and
taking it inside the worker would reproduce the AB-BA deadlock the esparser feeder is
already documented to cause.

Verified on the box as kernel #87 (the unhardened form was #86, and three natural endings
on it produced exactly one isLast=1 each, one reportEOSWork each, playToEndOfStream down
from 25622 to 78-81, and the player returned to SmartTube's own browse screen unaided).
Boot images are assembled from the installed image's own ramdisk and cmdline, both proved
byte-identical.
---
diff --git a/drivers/staging/media/meson/vdec/vdec.h b/drivers/staging/media/meson/vdec/vdec.h
--- a/drivers/staging/media/meson/vdec/vdec.h
+++ b/drivers/staging/media/meson/vdec/vdec.h
@@ -283,6 +283,19 @@
 	unsigned int drain_stable_ticks;
 	unsigned int drain_total_ticks;
 
+	/*
+	 * h96 21.09: zavershenie drain. last_sent - V4L2_BUF_FLAG_LAST uzhe
+	 * otdan za etu ostanovku; last_dst_jiffies - kogda zhelezo v poslednij
+	 * raz vernulo kadr; eos_work dozhimaet drain pustym buferom s LAST,
+	 * esli obychnyj put' etogo ne sdelal.
+	 */
+	struct delayed_work eos_work;
+	unsigned long last_dst_jiffies;
+	unsigned long stop_jiffies;
+	unsigned int eos_ticks;
+	unsigned int last_sent;
+	unsigned int drain_issued;
+
 	unsigned int streamon_cap, streamon_out;
 	unsigned int sequence_cap, sequence_out;
 	unsigned int should_stop;
diff --git a/drivers/staging/media/meson/vdec/vdec_helpers.c b/drivers/staging/media/meson/vdec/vdec_helpers.c
--- a/drivers/staging/media/meson/vdec/vdec_helpers.c
+++ b/drivers/staging/media/meson/vdec/vdec_helpers.c
@@ -500,7 +500,10 @@
 	vbuf->flags = flags;
 	vbuf->timecode = timecode;
 
-	if (sess->should_stop &&
+	/* h96 21.09: otmetka dlya vdec_eos_work - zhelezo eshche otdaet kadry */
+	sess->last_dst_jiffies = jiffies;
+
+	if (sess->should_stop && !sess->last_sent &&
 	    atomic_read(&sess->esparser_queued_bufs) <= 1) {
 		const struct v4l2_event ev = { .type = V4L2_EVENT_EOS };
 
@@ -508,6 +511,7 @@
 			sess->sequence_cap - 1);
 		v4l2_event_queue_fh(&sess->fh, &ev);
 		vbuf->flags |= V4L2_BUF_FLAG_LAST;
+		sess->last_sent = 1;
 	} else if (sess->status == STATUS_NEEDS_RESUME) {
 		/* Mark LAST for drained show frames during a source change */
 		vbuf->flags |= V4L2_BUF_FLAG_LAST;
diff --git a/drivers/staging/media/meson/vdec/vdec.c b/drivers/staging/media/meson/vdec/vdec.c
--- a/drivers/staging/media/meson/vdec/vdec.c
+++ b/drivers/staging/media/meson/vdec/vdec.c
@@ -263,14 +263,106 @@
 			queued, sess->drain_stable_ticks,
 			sess->drain_total_ticks);
 		vdec_wait_inactive(sess);
-		if (codec_ops->drain)
+		if (codec_ops->drain) {
+			sess->drain_issued = 1;
 			codec_ops->drain(sess);
+		}
 		return;
 	}
 
 	schedule_delayed_work(&sess->drain_work, msecs_to_jiffies(100));
 }
 
+/*
+ * h96 21.09: zavershenie drain po specifikacii V4L2.
+ *
+ * Stateful-dekoder OBYAZAN zakonchit V4L2_DEC_CMD_STOP CAPTURE-buferom s
+ * V4L2_BUF_FLAG_LAST, a esli dekodirovannyh kadrov bolshe net - PUSTYM
+ * buferom (bytesused = 0) s etim flagom.
+ *
+ * Zdes LAST veshalsya tolko na realnyj kadr i tolko pri
+ * esparser_queued_bufs <= 1. Etot schetchik uchityvaet i kadry, kotorye
+ * eshche derzhit DPB, a umenshaetsya POSLE dst_buf_done(), poetomu k koncu
+ * rolika do 1 on ne dohodit. Progon 21.09 (h264, 393 s, estestvennyj
+ * konec): posle CMD_STOP vyshli 6 hvostovyh kadrov, isLast=0 u vseh
+ * 3034 vydach CAPTURE za ves progon, i ochered zamerla navsegda.
+ * ExoPlayer pri etom slil zvuk i 4 minuty vyzyval playToEndOfStream
+ * ~100 raz v sekundu: video-render nikogda ne konchaetsya, plejer ne
+ * zakryvaetsya i ne perehodit k sleduyushchemu roliku.
+ *
+ * Posle CMD_STOP zhdem 200 ms tishiny na CAPTURE i, esli LAST tak i ne
+ * ushel, otdaem pustoj bufer s LAST i sobytiem EOS. Potolok ozhidaniya
+ * klientskogo bufera - 3 s.
+ *
+ * Lok zdes ne berem (kak i vdec_drain_work): vdec_stop_streaming()
+ * vyzyvaet cancel_delayed_work_sync() pod tem zhe sess->lock, i vzyatie
+ * loka vnutri vorkera dalo by AB-BA dedlok.
+ */
+static void vdec_eos_work(struct work_struct *work)
+{
+	struct amvdec_session *sess =
+		container_of(to_delayed_work(work), struct amvdec_session,
+			     eos_work);
+	const struct v4l2_event ev = { .type = V4L2_EVENT_EOS };
+	struct amvdec_codec_ops *codec_ops;
+	struct vb2_v4l2_buffer *vbuf;
+	unsigned int i;
+
+	if (sess->stopping || !sess->should_stop || sess->last_sent)
+		return;
+
+	codec_ops = sess->fmt_out->codec_ops;
+
+	/*
+	 * Ne obryvat hvost: terminator imeet pravo srabotat tolko posle togo,
+	 * kak sbros DPB realno ZAPROSHEN. Dlya codec_ops->drain (vp9, hevc)
+	 * eto drain_issued iz vdec_drain_work, kotoryj zhdet uspokoeniya
+	 * esparser do 10 s; dlya eos_sequence (h264) - eos_queued, t.e.
+	 * fiktivnaya kartinka uzhe ushla v firmware. Absolyutnyj predel 15 s
+	 * ot CMD_STOP vse ravno ostaetsya: obrezannyj hvost luchshe vechnogo
+	 * zavisaniya, radi kotorogo etot patch i sdelan.
+	 */
+	if (time_before(jiffies, sess->stop_jiffies + msecs_to_jiffies(15000))) {
+		if (codec_ops->drain && !sess->drain_issued)
+			goto again;
+		if (!codec_ops->drain && codec_ops->eos_sequence &&
+		    !sess->eos_queued)
+			goto again;
+
+		/* zhelezo eshche otdaet kadry - pust LAST povesit obychnyj put */
+		if (time_before(jiffies,
+				sess->last_dst_jiffies + msecs_to_jiffies(200))) {
+			sess->eos_ticks = 0;
+			goto again;
+		}
+	}
+
+	vbuf = v4l2_m2m_dst_buf_remove(sess->m2m_ctx);
+	if (!vbuf) {
+		/* klient poka ne vernul ni odnogo svobodnogo CAPTURE-bufera */
+		if (++sess->eos_ticks > 60) {
+			dev_warn(sess->core->dev,
+				 "vdec: drain ne zavershen, net CAPTURE-bufera\n");
+			return;
+		}
+		goto again;
+	}
+
+	for (i = 0; i < vbuf->vb2_buf.num_planes; i++)
+		vb2_set_plane_payload(&vbuf->vb2_buf, i, 0);
+
+	vbuf->sequence = sess->sequence_cap++;
+	vbuf->field = V4L2_FIELD_NONE;
+	sess->last_sent = 1;
+	dev_dbg(sess->core->dev, "vdec: drain zavershen pustym LAST\n");
+	v4l2_event_queue_fh(&sess->fh, &ev);
+	v4l2_m2m_last_buffer_done(sess->m2m_ctx, vbuf);
+	return;
+
+again:
+	schedule_delayed_work(&sess->eos_work, msecs_to_jiffies(50));
+}
+
 static void vdec_poweroff(struct amvdec_session *sess)
 {
 	cancel_delayed_work_sync(&sess->drain_work);
@@ -522,6 +614,8 @@
 		 */
 		sess->should_stop = 0;
 		sess->eos_queued = 0;
+		sess->last_sent = 0;
+		sess->drain_issued = 0;
 		/*
 		 * h96 0022 (07.09.2026): pri PERVOM DRC (256x144 -> realnoe
 		 * razreshenie) klient delaet STREAMOFF starogo CAPTURE ->
@@ -560,6 +654,8 @@
 
 	sess->should_stop = 0;
 	sess->eos_queued = 0;
+	sess->last_sent = 0;
+	sess->drain_issued = 0;
 	sess->stopping = 0;
 	sess->keyframe_found = 0;
 	sess->last_offset = 0;
@@ -640,6 +736,7 @@
 	struct vb2_v4l2_buffer *buf;
 
 	cancel_delayed_work_sync(&sess->drain_work);
+	cancel_delayed_work_sync(&sess->eos_work);
 	/*
 	 * h96 04.09.2026: stopping vystavlyaem SRAZU, do vsego. Kormilku
 	 * esparser NEL'ZYA gasit' cherez cancel_work_sync() otsyuda: eta
@@ -1025,9 +1122,12 @@
 
 	if (cmd->cmd == V4L2_DEC_CMD_START) {
 		cancel_delayed_work_sync(&sess->drain_work);
+		cancel_delayed_work_sync(&sess->eos_work);
 		v4l2_m2m_clear_state(sess->m2m_ctx);
 		sess->should_stop = 0;
 		sess->eos_queued = 0;
+		sess->last_sent = 0;
+		sess->drain_issued = 0;
 		return 0;
 	}
 
@@ -1038,6 +1138,11 @@
 	dev_dbg(dev, "Received V4L2_DEC_CMD_STOP\n");
 
 	sess->should_stop = 1;
+	sess->last_sent = 0;
+	sess->drain_issued = 0;
+	sess->eos_ticks = 0;
+	sess->stop_jiffies = jiffies;
+	sess->last_dst_jiffies = jiffies;
 
 	v4l2_m2m_mark_stopped(sess->m2m_ctx);
 
@@ -1058,6 +1163,9 @@
 		vdec_wait_inactive(sess);
 	}
 
+	/* h96 21.09: strakhovka - drain obyazan zakonchitsya buferom s LAST */
+	schedule_delayed_work(&sess->eos_work, msecs_to_jiffies(250));
+
 	return ret;
 }
 
@@ -1218,6 +1326,7 @@
 	INIT_LIST_HEAD(&sess->bufs_recycle);
 	INIT_WORK(&sess->esparser_queue_work, esparser_queue_all_src);
 	INIT_DELAYED_WORK(&sess->drain_work, vdec_drain_work);
+	INIT_DELAYED_WORK(&sess->eos_work, vdec_eos_work);
 	mutex_init(&sess->lock);
 	mutex_init(&sess->bufs_recycle_lock);
 	spin_lock_init(&sess->ts_spinlock);
